 Work(ticket job);seconds;payload;r
⍝ Do the work for one ticket, then post the result to the job's callback URL: this is the web hook
⍝ Runs in its own thread, started by Submit. Not an endpoint (see IncludeFns in Run2).
⍝ Everything is inside :Trap, because nothing else catches an error in this thread:
⍝ untrapped, it would suspend the thread (in a session) or stop APL (in a script), and the client would never know
 :Trap 0
     seconds←{6::1+?3 ⋄ ⍵.seconds}job
⍝ v20: seconds←job ⎕VGET ⊂'seconds' (1+?3)
     ⎕DL seconds ⍝ pretend the work takes a while, so results arrive out of order
     payload←⎕NS''
     payload.(ticket n factors)←ticket job.n(Factors job.n)
⍝ v20: payload←⎕NS'' ⋄ payload ⎕VSET ('ticket' ticket)((,'n') job.n)('factors' (Factors job.n))
     r←#.HttpCommand.GetJSON'post'job.callback payload
     :If r.rc≠0 ⍝ the request failed: e.g. the callback server is not running
         ⎕←'Ticket ',(⍕ticket),': could not reach ',job.callback,': ',r.msg
     :ElseIf r.HttpStatus≠200 ⍝ the callback server said no
         ⎕←'Ticket ',(⍕ticket),': ',job.callback,' answered with HTTP status ',⍕r.HttpStatus
     :EndIf
 :Else
     ⎕←'Ticket ',(⍕ticket),': the work failed: ',⎕DMX.EM,(0<≢⎕DMX.Message)/': ',⎕DMX.Message
 :EndTrap
